== 3. One root profile on the management cluster fetches that release, as Argo CD's app of apps does (07:56:59)
$ cat root.yaml
# The management cluster's root profile: it fetches the management Space's
# release, which holds every delivery profile, and applies it to the
# management cluster itself, as Argo CD's app of apps does.
apiVersion: config.projectsveltos.io/v1beta1
kind: ClusterProfile
metadata:
  name: mer-management
spec:
  clusterRefs:
    - apiVersion: lib.projectsveltos.io/v1beta1
      kind: SveltosCluster
      namespace: mgmt
      name: mgmt
  syncMode: ContinuousWithDriftDetection
  # Removing the root must never withdraw the delivery profiles, and with them
  # every add-on on every cluster.
  stopMatchingBehavior: LeavePolicies
  continueOnError: true
  policyRefs:
    - deploymentType: Remote
      remoteURL:
        url: oci://oci.hub.confighub.com/space/mer-management:latest
        interval: 1m0s
        secretRef:
          name: confighub-mer-targets
          namespace: projectsveltos
$ kubectl apply -f root.yaml
clusterprofile.config.projectsveltos.io/mer-management created
