== A release that is not there yet (07:59:18, by hand)
-- A profile pointed at a Space with no release, on eu-central-test1. After 75 seconds its ClusterSummary said:
{"features":[{"status":"Failed","failureMessage":"failed to pull OCI artifact oci://oci.hub.confighub.com/space/mer-policies:latest: oci.hub.confighub.com/space/mer-policies:latest: not found","consecutiveFailures":3}]}
-- So the record must not hold a delivery profile before its variant has a release. The probe profile was deleted.

